      "message": "Hi @ddoman@chromium.org In crrev.com/c/6965238 a reviewer left a comment that my change to a mojom file is not formatted as expected which made me realize these files are not formatted by default when running `git cl format` although a formatter is available. Also the current versions of the mojom files in Chromium do not follow the expected format so running the formatter on-demand produces large diffs which makes it difficult to address the review comments. What do you think about enabling mojom formatting by default if the formatter is available? I believe it would help catch formatting issues that are otherwise not caught by reviewers.",
